     2	exercised by test_dims.py on synthetic fixtures (DESIGN 7, decision-rule synthetics).
     3	
     4	Conventions: a per-case record is (e_X, e_Y, eps, eligible); "eligible" already includes E0 eligibility, both
     5	configurations numerically qualified and both runs valid (the caller passes unqualified cells as `qualified=False`).
